{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Emoji Mood Journal 讓你以 Emoji 在數秒內記下當下心情，點選情緒、標記今日活動，即可建立溫和無壓力的每日日記，過程無需註冊帳戶。程式原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費，適合想用簡單低壓方式瞭解自身情緒與日常節奏的使用者。</p>\n\n<h2>心情趨勢一目瞭然</h2>\n<p>開啟程式即可用 Emoji 一鍵記錄心情，並加上文字備註；活動標籤可記下工作、運動與社交行程。時間軸提供日記列表、每月回顧與年度熱圖，統計頁顯示 7、30、90 天心情趨勢、分佈圖表及最常進行的活動，並有連續記錄計數器協助養成習慣。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-54-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-55-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-56-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-57-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-58-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Emoji Mood Journal – Daily Log</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-06T22:18:13.180801+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":315,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}